<title>USA: MAIC Holdings sets 6 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>MAIC Holdings sets 6 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>MAIC Holdings Inc said on Wednesday its board of directors declared a six percent stock dividend, payable on February 17 to shareholders of record on January 17.</p>
<p>Cash would be paid in lieu of fractional shares, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
